{"4214700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sample Required", "steam_appid": 4214700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samples Required is a third person rogue-like tower defence where you can find new turret blueprints and items to equip on those turrets, or yourself. Experiment with different turrets and builds to find what works best for you, or just blow stuff up with rockets, your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and deploy various buildings to defend your ship from enemy ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/ef9e1e6ea14446cf629ea93357d60fbc.poster.avif?t=1777249895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/ef9e1e6ea14446cf629ea93357d60fbc.webm?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/ef9e1e6ea14446cf629ea93357d60fbc.mp4?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your path through the galaxy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/44ffa39164679ac94133db0313f3f4ca.poster.avif?t=1777249895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/44ffa39164679ac94133db0313f3f4ca.webm?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/44ffa39164679ac94133db0313f3f4ca.mp4?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels to find rare loot and collect samples from an alien hivemind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/a340d5b3aa3d94736179af84cf9402f3.poster.avif?t=1777249895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/a340d5b3aa3d94736179af84cf9402f3.webm?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/a340d5b3aa3d94736179af84cf9402f3.mp4?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samples Required is a third person rogue-like tower defence where you can find new turret blueprints and items to equip on those turrets, or yourself. Experiment with different turrets and builds to find what works best for you, or just blow stuff up with rockets, your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and deploy various buildings to defend your ship from enemy ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/ef9e1e6ea14446cf629ea93357d60fbc.poster.avif?t=1777249895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/ef9e1e6ea14446cf629ea93357d60fbc.webm?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/ef9e1e6ea14446cf629ea93357d60fbc.mp4?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your path through the galaxy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/44ffa39164679ac94133db0313f3f4ca.poster.avif?t=1777249895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/44ffa39164679ac94133db0313f3f4ca.webm?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/44ffa39164679ac94133db0313f3f4ca.mp4?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels to find rare loot and collect samples from an alien hivemind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/a340d5b3aa3d94736179af84cf9402f3.poster.avif?t=1777249895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/a340d5b3aa3d94736179af84cf9402f3.webm?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/extras/a340d5b3aa3d94736179af84cf9402f3.mp4?t=1777249895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Embark on a journey through space and defend your ship with turrets while you explore planets for upgrades, items, and samples! Defeat, while not ideal, is not the end as there's always another set of dispatch drones to try again with.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214700/88f89eb9efb50c2d405db39c38e4b4ba95ffc2af/header.jpg?t=1777249895", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app